2.12. Implementasi Binary Search dengan Python
Contoh 2.17 Fungsi Binary Search iteratif
def binary_search(data, target):
  left = 0
  right = len(data) - 1

  while left <= right:
    mid = (left + right) // 2

  if data[mid] == target:
    return mid
  elif data[mid] < target:
    left = mid + 1
  else:
    right = mid - 1

  return -1

  2.12.2 Menjalankan Fungsi
